typan-war-guide-title = Station War
typan-war-guide-body =
    T+0 — war declared, bluespace jumps blocked until hostilities begin. NT and Typan stations are placed on one map, 300 tiles apart.
    T+0:30 — hostilities begin; war armories unlock (TypanWarArmory tag).
    T+10 min — three 3×3 capture zones spawn automatically in random open areas (NT station, Typan station, trade post). Central Command announces labels A/B/C with locations.
    Hold a zone to receive periodic NT or Syndicate surplus crates.
    30 min — combat timer; win by fewer losses or total elimination.
    Ally Protection — do not hit allies with ranged weapons.
